    ["<Highlight>【星灵奇装】</>\n群星璀璨之时，星光加身一刻，美将再现于此。\n\n<Highlight>【召唤规则】</>\n使用星币进行灵界召唤，概率获得珍贵的宝物奖励。\n奖励分为<Highlight>神眷</>、<Highlight>灵幻</>、<Highlight>非凡</>三档。累计使用<Highlight>10</>个星币且未获得神眷奖励后，神眷概率逐渐增加，每使用<Highlight>40个</>星币必定获得<Highlight>神眷</>奖励，每使用<Highlight>10个</>星币必定获得<Highlight>灵幻</>奖励。\n召唤获得的奖励均无法交易或赠送。\n\n<Highlight>【其它规则】</>\n使用<Highlight>裁刀</>可以在星灵秘库商店兑换奖励，获得超过拥有上限的灵幻或神眷档次外观奖励时，将会被分解为特定数量的<Highlight>裁刀</>。\n获得神眷品质奖励时，将<Highlight>优先获得未拥有</>的外观奖励（神眷发型与时装散件分开计算），可在外观收集进度中查看详情。\n\n<Highlight>【概率公示】</>\n神眷奖励概率（含保底）：5.230%\n<Highlight>神眷发型</>：0.596%\n<Highlight>神眷时装散件</>：4.634%\n\n灵幻奖励概率（含保底）：12.222%\n风暴之泪、玫瑰藤杖、栖蝶披风、蔷薇之缚、银蔷薇\n\n非凡奖励概率（含保底）：82.548%\n聚合因子、泡沫染膏、珊瑚染料、爆爆烟花、彩带烟花、派对烟花、古怪的药剂、简易的火把、纯情鲁特琴、小象玩偶、冰冷的裹布、荣耀的传承、卷毛狒狒的毛发、幸运大转盘、贝壳项链、珍珠胸花"] = "<Highlight>【Star Spirit Exotic Attire】</>\nWhen the stars shine bright and starlight descends, beauty shall reappear here.\n\n<Highlight>【Summoning Rules】</>\nUse Star Coins to perform Spirit World summoning for a chance to obtain precious treasure rewards.\nRewards are divided into three tiers: <Highlight>God's Favor</>, <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</>, and <Highlight>Beyonder</>. After using a total of <Highlight>10</> Star Coins without obtaining a God's Favor reward, the probability of obtaining one will gradually increase. Every <Highlight>40</> Star Coins used guarantees a <Highlight>God's Favor</> reward, and every <Highlight>10</> Star Coins used guarantees a <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</> reward.\n Rewards obtained from summoning cannot be traded or gifted.\n\n<Highlight>【Other Rules】</>\nUse <Highlight>Cutting Blades</> to exchange for rewards in the Star Spirit Secret Vault Shop. If you obtain a Spirit Illusion or God's Favor tier cosmetic reward that exceeds your ownership limit, it will be decomposed into a specific number of <Highlight>Cutting Blades</>.\nWhen obtaining a God's Favor quality reward, you will <Highlight>prioritize obtaining unowned</> cosmetic rewards (God's Favor hairstyles and outfit pieces are calculated separately). You can view details in the Cosmetic Collection Progress.\n\n<Highlight>【Probability Disclosure】</>\nGod's Favor reward probability (including pity): 5.230%\n<Highlight>God's Favor Hairstyle</>: 0.596%\n<Highlight>God's Favor Outfit Piece</>: 4.634%\n\nSpirit Illusion reward probability (including pity): 12.222%\nStorm's Tear, Rose Vine Staff, Butterfly-Perching Cape, Rose Binding, Silver Rose\n\nBeyonder reward probability (including pity): 82.548%\nAggregation Factor, Foam Dye, Coral Dye, Pop Fireworks, Ribbon Fireworks, Party Fireworks, Eccentric Potion, Simple Torch, Innocent Lute, Elephant Doll, Cold Shroud, Glorious Inheritance, Curly-Haired Baboon Hair, Lucky Big Wheel, Seashell Necklace, Pearl Corsage",
